# canvas-app: soma-messages
# Demo-only parity UI, with native rich-link fixtures from the isolated API branch.
# Soma Messages linked to the Mac's iMessage service (0.6+). Against the service's DEMO on the Mac Pro: sample
# chats only, nothing of Boss's; every send gets a fake reply 2 s later. The harness must inject its ephemeral port/token; the checked-in endpoint fails closed.
shell cmd statusbar collapse
key HOME
# A clean start: not linked yet, no contacts answer.
shell pm clear dev.omalauncher.messages
# Contacts allowed ahead, so Android's prompt (whose title also says Allow) doesn't cover the inbox.
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.READ_CONTACTS
# 0.7+ asks for notifications when linked; granted here so its prompt does not cover the inbox.
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.POST_NOTIFICATIONS
shell pm grant dev.omalauncher.messages android.permission.RECORD_AUDIO
# Quoted twice: walk.py hands the line to the phone's shell, which would split the link at '&'.
shell am start -a android.intent.action.VIEW -d "'soma-messages://link?url=http%3A%2F%2F127.0.0.1%3A1&token=INJECT_EPHEMERAL_DEMO_TOKEN'" dev.omalauncher.messages
wait 2500
# The owner says yes to the Mac by name before anything goes to it.
expect Get your iMessages from 100.120.219.46?
shot link-dialog
tap Link
wait 1500
# Names come from the phone's contacts; the Mac's names stand in when the phone has none.
wait 4000
expect Weekend
expect Ana Demo
absent OpenBubbles
shot inbox-from-the-mac
# Guarded mutations on fresh synthetic own messages. The harness checks counts/history and rejects a sixth edit.
tap Ana Demo
doubletap Undo this demo message
expect Undo Send
shot eligible-message-actions card=messages-parity-edit-actions
tap Undo Send
wait 1000
expect You unsent a message
absent Undo this demo message
shot unsent-notice card=messages-parity-unsent
doubletap Edit this demo message
expect Edit
tap Edit
expect Edit message
replace "Edit message" CANCELLED-EDIT
shot inline-edit-cancel card=messages-parity-inline-edit
tap Cancel edit
absent CANCELLED-EDIT
expect Edit this demo message
doubletap Edit this demo message
tap Edit
replace "Edit message" EDIT-ONE
tap Save edit
expect EDIT-ONE
expect Edited
shot first-edit card=messages-parity-inline-edit
doubletap EDIT-ONE
tap Edit
replace "Edit message" EDIT-TWO
tap Save edit
expect EDIT-TWO
doubletap EDIT-TWO
tap Edit
replace "Edit message" EDIT-THREE
tap Save edit
expect EDIT-THREE
doubletap EDIT-THREE
tap Edit
replace "Edit message" EDIT-FOUR
tap Save edit
expect EDIT-FOUR
doubletap EDIT-FOUR
tap Edit
replace "Edit message" EDIT-FIVE
tap Save edit
expect EDIT-FIVE
doubletap EDIT-FIVE
expect Show replies
absentexact Edit
shot fifth-edit-menu card=messages-parity-edit-actions
key BACK
tap Edit history for: EDIT-FIVE
expect Edit history
expect Current
expect Edit this demo message
expect EDIT-ONE
expect EDIT-FOUR
expect EDIT-FIVE
shot five-edit-history card=messages-parity-edit-history
tap Done
expect EDIT-FIVE
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.messages
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.messages/.MainActivity
tap Ana Demo
expect EDIT-FIVE
expect You unsent a message
tap Edit history for: EDIT-FIVE
expect EDIT-ONE
expect EDIT-FOUR
shot history-after-restart card=messages-parity-edit-history
tap Done
key BACK
expect Messages
